<br />
Almost all the tools available here were created BEFORE generative AI even existed (or before you were even born...), and I'm not even talking about the code, snippets, and docs yet.    <script type="text/javascript">      
<!--
        document.write('</div>');      
//-->
    </script>  </div></blockquote>
<br />

<br />
I was born in 1975 and have been gaming since I was 8 years old; I grew up watching the evolution of video games. Today, I feel like a dream has come true as I finish a complete game especially for a system I absolutely love. I’ve been following the forum for a while, but this is my first time posting. It’s true that many of the modern tools shared here were developed with the help of AI though, honestly, some people might prefer to be hypocritical and simply not mention that they used AI in their development process.</span><br />

